OL,3,ATories pledge to halt screen-based
OL,4,Aschool exams and cut coursework
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have promised to halt
OL,7,Fscreen-based exams and cut coursework
OL,8,Fin a bid to limit the use of AI by
OL,9,Fschoolchildren in England if the party
OL,10,Freturns to power.
OL,12,FThe party has also pledged to develop
OL,13,Fnew guidelines so that laptops and
OL,14,Ftablets are not the "default in
OL,15,Fclassrooms".
OL,17,FShadow education secretary Laura Trott
OL,18,Fcited recent warnings from clinicians
OL,19,Fthat excessive screen time could be
OL,20,Fdamaging children's health, adding that
OL,21,F"everything in schools must be safe for
OL,22,Fchildren and improve standards".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
