OL,3,ATories pledge to halt screen-based
OL,4,Aschool exams and cut coursework
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is currently developing
OL,7,Fnew screen-time guidance for children
OL,8,Fand has previously said it would
OL,9,Fconsult on the safety of AI in schools.
